From: Jackie <jackie.han@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 08:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: workaround for unsupported memory type 10

Add support for QMI memory region type 10 to prevent firmware boot failure
on QCN9274 hw2.0.

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/qmi.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/qmi.c
@@ -2651,6 +2651,7 @@ static int ath12k_qmi_alloc_target_mem_c
                case PAGEABLE_MEM_REGION_TYPE:
                case CALDB_MEM_REGION_TYPE:
                case LPASS_SHARED_V01_REGION_TYPE:
+               case 10:
                        ret = ath12k_qmi_alloc_chunk(ab, chunk);
                        if (ret)
                                goto err;
